# Platform: mobilesite
# Imported from Testsigma: NCT Ask for Price (test case 2351, run 115613, last result SUCCESS)
# Tags: regression
# OFF steps: every step that would send a REAL lead / enquiry / OTP is switched off,
#   plus the checks that only pass after it. Switch them on only when a lead is wanted.
# Params : mobile_9987

call Live_Touch_Chrome_Navigate_to_Homepage_setup_Popup
open https://www.justdial.com/Mumbai/Cranes-On-Rent-in-Link-Road-Malad-West/nct-10146502?fl=undefined&ismap=undefined&subpage=&searchCase=&term=crane&searchLocUpdate=0&jdxflag=0&ll=searchbox&cbflg=1&stype=category_list&srcterm=Cranes%20On%20Rent&trkid=21263-mumbai
wait for page to load
call PS_Touch_Consent_Popup
swipe bottom to top until element nct_ask_for_price is visible, max 15 times, wait 1
verify text "Ask for Price" on page
click nct_ask_for_price
verify element nct_login_ask_for_price is visible
verify element prp_open_rfq_login_pop_jd_logo is visible
verify element nct_login_text_ask_for_price is visible
click touch_login_popup_may_be_later
click nct_ask_for_price
type "${mobile_9987}" into prp_login_mobile
js click nct_login_pop_continue_button
type "${otp}" into nct_login_otp_field
verify element nct_ask_for_price_acknowledgement_toast_msg is visible
delete all cookies
open https://www.justdial.com/
wait for page to load
call PS_Touch_Location_Popup
click touch_signin_home_page
wait 1 seconds
click touch_home_english_tab
wait until element touch_home_hindi_langauge is visible
click touch_home_hindi_langauge
wait 2 seconds
open https://www.justdial.com/Mumbai/Cranes-On-Rent-in-Link-Road-Malad-West/nct-10146502?fl=undefined&ismap=undefined&subpage=&searchCase=&term=crane&searchLocUpdate=0&jdxflag=0&ll=searchbox&cbflg=1&stype=category_list&srcterm=Cranes%20On%20Rent&trkid=21263-mumbai
wait until element text_ask_price_in_hindi is visible
click text_ask_price_in_hindi
call SG_Ask_for_Price_Non_Login_to_Login_Hindi
